#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: llmo-blog-optimizer.php
msgid "LLMO Ready - Blog Optimizer"
msgstr "LLMO Ready - Blog Optimizer"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: llmo-blog-optimizer.php
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/llmo-ready-blog-optimizer/"
msgstr "https://wordpress.org/plugins/llmo-ready-blog-optimizer/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: llmo-blog-optimizer.php
msgid "Automatically adds Schema.org JSON-LD markup with AI-optimized content from LLMO Ready to blog posts for better visibility in generative AI search engines (ChatGPT, Google SGE, Perplexity)."
msgstr "Setzt automatisch Schema.org-JSON-LD mit KI-optimierten Inhalten aus Libers Suite in deine Beiträge. So werden sie in generativen KI-Suchmaschinen besser sichtbar (ChatGPT, Google SGE, Perplexity)."

